      "content": "Those are great, especially Option 2. I like how it frames the enlightenment of the character. To bolster the argument in the second paragraph, can you explain why this specific type of character arc—showing a rigid person becoming more empathetic—is such a logically sound way to expose the inherent flaws and intellectual failures of that political faction? I want to make the connection between the character's growth and the opposition's obsolescence really clear.",
